@AbacAuthorization_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088
@Token = SEU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI
@DocumentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Registrar usuário do departamento Financeiro
POST {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@empresa.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "department": "Finance",
  "role": "user"
}

### 2. Registrar usuário Admin
POST {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "department": "IT",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@empresa.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Criar documento (Requer mesmo Department do usuário)
POST {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Relatório Q3",
  "department": "Finance",
  "content": "Conteúdo confidencial do departamento financeiro"
}

### 5. Ler documento (Permitido para o Author ou mesmo Department)
GET {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Atualizar documento (Requer ser o Author e manter o documento no seu Department)
PUT {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Relatório Q3 - Atualizado",
  "department": "Finance",
  "content": "Conteúdo atualizado"
}

### 7. Ler documento via rota Admin (Requer role "admin" e horário entre 07:00 e 23:00 de America/Sao_Paulo)
GET {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/admin/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Excluir documento (Requer ser o Author)
DELETE {{AbacAuthorization_HostAddress}}/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

